{"__lastUpdated": "2026-10-07T21:53:51.334Z", "__OculusDBType": "Application", "group": 0, "binaryType": 1, "hmd": 1, "__sn": "splootybean", "blocked": false, "appName": "Catastrophic Inversion", "baseline_offer": null, "priceFormatted": "0.-01", "priceOffsetNumerical": -1, "priceLimboDetected": false, "appHasDiscount": false, "discountEndTime": "0001-01-01T00:00:00", "appHasTrial": false, "appCanBeBought": false, "currency": "", "canonicalName": "toastid-waffel-catastrophic-inversion-android6d0f-x2wxnm", "current_gift_offer": null, "current_offer": null, "current_trial_offer": null, "displayName": "Catastrophic Inversion", "display_name": "Catastrophic Inversion", "display_long_description": "**Catastrophic Inversion** is the multiplayer shooter for large spaces. After a quick mapping of your space, it accurately aligns all players, allowing you to move around together in the same space.\n\n**TRANSFORM YOUR SPACE INTO A MULTI-LEVEL VR BATTLEGROUND**\n[media]\n**FIGHT YOUR FRIENDS IN A GROWING COLLECTION OF PVP ARENAS**\n[media]\n**EXPLORE AND SURVIVE TOGETHER (OR ALONE) IN ADVENTURE MODE**\n[media]\n**Quick Notes:**\n- Most maps require 24x14m (79x46') to play in shared-space. There are also some 10x10m (33x33') maps. Stationary / room-scale play available for all maps.\n- Dedicated host & spectator available on PC. Hosting from the PC version is recommended (but not required) for multiplayer.\n- Games auto-connect over Wi-Fi on your local network. There are currently no official online servers, but peer-to-peer online games are possible.\n\nSee our website for the latest info.", "display_long_description_unprocessed": "**Catastrophic Inversion** is the multiplayer shooter for large spaces. After a quick mapping of your space, it accurately aligns all players, allowing you to move around together in the same space.\n\n**TRANSFORM YOUR SPACE INTO A MULTI-LEVEL VR BATTLEGROUND**\n![{\"height\":320,\"type\":\"video\",\"width\":1280}](https://scontent.oculuscdn.com/v/t